text: ["As Meddling Mage enters the battlefield, choose a nonland card name.\\nSpells with the chosen name can't be cast.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control six or more lands, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 1 life.', 'Barren Moor enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.\\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield, exile target player's graveyard.\\n{T}: Add {B}.", 'Creature tokens get -2/-2.', 'Destroy target nonland permanent and all other permanents with the same name as that permanent.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each other enchantment on the battlefield.', 'First strike\\nNoncreature spells cost {1} more to cast.', "Flying\\nYou can't lose the game and your opponents can't win the game.", 'Forgotten Cave enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Kicker {R} (You may pay an additional {R} as you cast this spell.)\\nHaste\\nWhen Goblin Ruinblaster enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, destroy target nonbasic land.', 'Knight of the Reliquary gets +1/+1 for each land card in your graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Forest or Plains: Search your library for a land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Lonely Sandbar enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\nCycling {U} ({U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever you cast a Merfolk spell, you may tap or untap target permanent.', "Pack Rat's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Rats you control.\\n{2}{B}, Discard a card: Create a token that's a copy of Pack Rat.", 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Trample\\nTerravore's power and toughness are each equal to the number of land cards in all graveyards.", 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'When Brain Maggot enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals their hand and you choose a nonland card from it. Exile that card until Brain Maggot leaves the battlefield.', 'When Ranger of Eos enters the battlefield, you may search your library for up to two creature cards with mana value 1 or less, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a creature card, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\\nWhenever an opponent discards a land card, add {B}{B}.\\nWhenever an opponent discards a noncreature, nonland card, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a spell, proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Ghost Quarter: Destroy target land. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.']
flavor: ['"Cast out by my tribe, I am a pariah trapped in this mammal\'s carcass. Only my true kin hear my cries."', '"Knowledge of Bant\'s landscape and ruins is a weapon that the invaders can\'t comprehend."\\n—Elspeth', 'Designed by the Magic community', 'During the collision of the shards, entire ways of life disappeared without a trace.', "The masks, like the ancient trees they're grown from, lend strength to the dryads."]
